# My Sandbox

This sandbox gathers my research work on multiphase flow simulations and multiphysics modelling using the Basilisk framework.

The primary focus is the numerical simulation of moving-interface problems, including diffusion-driven phase change and solidification phenomena.

Future developments will include multiphysics models of the iron-pellet melting process relevant to steelmaking applications.

The repository is actively maintained and will be updated with new solvers, validation cases, and application studies.

Codes to be uploaded soon !!!
